1
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:29,897
Every time the rain no longer falls, and I
see the sky, I think the rain is falling.

2
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,360
Back to when I was a child,

3
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:37,580
who could only cry,
blindly chasing after him.

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,420
I fell far behind my only thought,
one day I will be stronger.

5
00:00:46,060 --> 00:00:50,600
Bridery and gratitude
fading with the wind.

6
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:55,297
Am I stronger now than I was
before, or as weak as back then?

7
00:00:55,380 --> 00:01:01,157
I don't know for sure, but until
I do, my voyage will not end.

8
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:06,340
No matter what's next, I'm
walking straight ahead!

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,577
So let's go, there's nothing
that can stop us now.

10
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:17,477
Though times are on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

11
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:22,577
And we may fall, but we'll
always keep on standing.

12
00:01:22,660 --> 00:01:28,697
There's no way anything will take
what I hold dear away from me.

13
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:33,657
The voices inside me push
me to keep surviving.

14
00:01:33,740 --> 00:01:39,257
I'll go on, I'll get through,
no matter what I gotta do.

15
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:43,177
The fiercest of all can pour upon me.

16
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:48,800
I don't care why in the
world would I turn back?

17
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:57,877
So let's go, there's nothing
that can stop us now.

18
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:02,920
Though time's not on our side,
we'll never let it pull us down.

19
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:07,877
And we may fall, but we'll
always keep on standing.

20
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:14,097
There's no way everything will
take what I hold dear away from me.

21
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:17,640
I know the future's there for us to see?

22
00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:32,180
We're good!

23
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,960
Ace is still alive, guys!

24
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,828
Hey, pull it together, pal.

25
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,828
That power, it came
from Ace's brother, huh?

26
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:40,170
What the?

27
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:42,144
I almost passed out back there.

28
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:52,217
That was the conqueror spirit
like Pops and Shanks use.

29
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:55,120
Damn that kid is full of surprises, huh?

30
00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:59,297
I don't think he realizes
what he just did.

31
00:02:59,380 --> 00:03:03,220
I tell you boys we got some
scary stuff right here!

32
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:14,117
He didn't learn that
power he was born with it.

33
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,200
Just like Pops.

34
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:18,977
If your will is weak, stand back!

35
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:21,260
He's not just another rookie.

36
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:23,757
Conqueror's spirit, huh?

37
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,177
We can't forget he's the son of dragon.

38
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:28,637
That's what we get for
underestimating him!

39
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,240
What next, Vice Admiral?

40
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:34,717
My energy hormones didn't do that What
hat did you pull those powers out of?

41
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,630
Power?

42
00:03:35,713 --> 00:03:36,543
What do you mean?

43
00:03:36,626 --> 00:03:37,653
We'll discuss it later.

44
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:39,077
He's not aware of it.

45
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:41,377
That means we can't count
on him using it again.

46
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:44,457
Either way, it's no wonder the
people are so drawn to him?

47
00:03:44,540 --> 00:03:48,020
The apple doesn't fall far
from the tree, does it, dragon?

48
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:53,620
Do not let that boy
escape this battlefield.

49
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:56,797
If he does, he'll turn
into a dire threat to us.

50
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,880
Dead or alive, you take him down.

51
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:07,840
Focus on Whitebeard first.

52
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:10,595
He may be a monster, but he's injured.

53
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,939
Take him down, then go for the kid.

54
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:15,220
After Straw Hat, hurry!

55
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:24,320
Stop and listen to me!

56
00:04:25,460 --> 00:04:26,560
What's wrong?

57
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,220
There's a new plan.

58
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:32,220
I'm either gonna live or I'm gonna die.

59
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:36,260
So back up Straw Hat with
everything you've got!

60
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,940
Ace's brother, why?

61
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:51,320
They're coming straight at ya! Watch out!

62
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:56,840
I know you.

63
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,240
You're Dome, the Bohemian Knight, correct?

64
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,060
Vice Admiral Momonga,
pleasure to meet you.

65
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:13,600
To the Calvert brothers,
it sucks to be you.

66
00:05:13,740 --> 00:05:15,120
You gotta fight us!

67
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,177
Thunderlord Mock!

68
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:22,613
Pardon me, Vice Admiral, but I require
a moment of your time if you would.

69
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:25,160
We've got some friends!

70
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:28,857
If Whitebeard says to lend you a
hand, then we're on it in a flash!

71
00:05:28,940 --> 00:05:30,537
Chase is right there, Straw Hat.

72
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:32,738
No way they're gonna stop all of us!

73
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,997
Whitebeard's allies are
backing up Straw Hat.

74
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,492
This does not look good.

75
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:46,340
Who are you guys?

76
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,620
Never mind that.

77
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:48,610
Keep running.

78
00:05:48,693 --> 00:05:51,157
The Navy forces are
focused on Pops right now.

79
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:55,337
So this might be your only chance to
slip past the admirals and move in.

80
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:58,832
We're slamming them all at
once, so wait for your opening.

81
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,680
Hey, not bad.

82
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,157
I think they like you.

83
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:06,711
The greatest pirate in the
world gave his seal of approval.

84
00:06:09,180 --> 00:06:11,797
Ace may be your brother,
but he's Whitebeard's son,

85
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,977
you know, and he trusts you with his life.

86
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:17,657
So why don't you stop trying to
be coy and rise to the occasion,

87
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:19,034
you cocky little snot?

88
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:23,217
I don't care what that old man wants,
and I don't care what he thinks either.

89
00:06:23,300 --> 00:06:25,720
I only came here to do one thing.

90
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,560
I don't need anyone's approval for that.

91
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,317
The pirates are gaining headway on us.

92
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,697
They're about to break through.

93
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:35,577
We need backup in a hurry.

94
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:38,197
With all due respect, maybe
we should change plans.

95
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,110
Not yet.

96
00:06:39,193 --> 00:06:42,237
If we have a chance to defeat
Whitebeard, then we must take it.

97
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,657
Everyone move in now.

98
00:06:43,740 --> 00:06:47,337
If he falls, then it's only a
matter of time for the rest of them.

99
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:51,217
One or 100 doesn't matter.

100
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:54,520
You can stand in line or
you can all die at once.

101
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:09,837
He's still up.

102
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,480
What's it going to take?

103
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,577
We think alike, brat.

104
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:18,837
As long as Ace goes home,
nothing else matters.

105
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,197
Show me the will of D.

106
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:23,057
Show me the future.

107
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:26,617
Even if my days are
numbered, I can see tomorrow.

108
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,477
Blazing through this battlefield.

109
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:31,477
Oh, Hawkeye.

110
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,057
This could get nasty.

111
00:07:33,140 --> 00:07:36,240
Did you hear me?

112
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,117
Thanks.

113
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,137
It's the president's order.

114
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,960
For now, we're still allies. Go.

115
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:50,060
Mr. One, I believe.

116
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,620
Look out!

117
00:08:09,100 --> 00:08:10,000
Crocodile Two?

118
00:08:11,660 --> 00:08:14,300
Stop sleeping on the job, Mr. One.

119
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:18,737
I thought it was like old times,
but maybe prison made me soft.

120
00:08:18,820 --> 00:08:20,760
You are needed here, Straw Hat.

121
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:23,560
Get moving before I change my mind.

122
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:29,700
This won't end well.

123
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,180
Are you certain?

124
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:35,217
I'm not in the mood to put up
with your crap or anyone else's.

125
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:37,947
If you want to fight,
then shut up and do it.

126
00:08:41,180 --> 00:08:46,100
Luffy I'm here I'll do everything
in my power to aid you.

127
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:51,340
Target is Monkey D Luffy open fire.

128
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:04,357
Boa Hancock incite aborting the attack.

129
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,620
That's enough.

130
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:12,100
Are you out of your damn mind?

131
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:15,997
This isn't the first time you've gotten
in the way, but it will be the last.

132
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,397
What are you trying to
accomplish here anyway?

133
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,892
You're going to lose your warlord status.

134
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:24,560
You foolish, misshapen man-child.

135
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:27,277
Your ignorance is an affront to my beauty.

136
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,480
My what now?

137
00:09:28,660 --> 00:09:31,072
I shall set a pearl of wisdom before you.

138
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:34,477
Love is always a
hurricane, you little pig.

139
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,900
Big, you're insane, aren't you?

140
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:48,760
Hishman Karate!

141
00:09:50,140 --> 00:09:52,120
Arabesque Brick Fist!

142
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:01,197
Jinbei, I can handle this, damn it.

143
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:05,600
I said to leave me and help Straw
Hat get to the scaffold, didn't I?

144
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:09,097
Sorry, friend, but I'm
not one of your pirates.

145
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:12,239
That means I don't have to
listen to a word you say.

146
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:15,000
Have it your way, then.

147
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,677
Everyone else has already done their part.

148
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,100
Now you do yours.

149
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:24,700
Keep on running and don't look back.

150
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,960
For better or worse, it's our turn now.

151
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:35,477
Look, I'm sorry to make you do this
when I know you're still recovering,

152
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:37,736
but we need your skills in particular

153
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,317
No apologies necessary.

154
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:43,640
I assure you I shall give it my best

155
00:11:17,260 --> 00:11:19,460
They made a bridge!

156
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:22,720
It's Sinasuma of the Revolutionary Army!

157
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:25,360
Is that handy or what? Thanks!

158
00:11:25,900 --> 00:11:28,237
Straw Hutt's headed
straight for the scaffold!

159
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,150
Stop him!

160
00:11:29,233 --> 00:11:31,002
Sorry, too busy to do it myself!

161
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,297
What are you doing?

162
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:34,860
Block his path! We can't, sir! See?

163
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,277
These pirates are blocking us!

164
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,940
We can't get past! Fools!

165
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,340
Use your guns!

166
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:41,100
Cannoneers, open fire!

167
00:11:56,300 --> 00:11:57,600
Damn! It's them!

168
00:11:58,640 --> 00:12:02,000
The Whitebeard Pirates team of commanders.

169
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,497
Pop said to watch your back.

170
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:09,600
So keep running, we got this!

171
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,520
Everyone push, we're breaking through!

172
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:32,120
Here he comes, man!

173
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:33,220
Come, come!

174
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,310
Battleaxe!

175
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:48,400
Take it straight to the
top. You got it! Thanks!

176
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,980
He's getting away!

177
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,360
Death wing!

178
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,060
If you really want to
rumble, then step right up!

179
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,540
Hee-haw!

180
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:07,100
Now you just keep on
shining, Strawboy. It worked!

181
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,297
He's gonna make it!

182
00:13:08,380 --> 00:13:09,210
We got this!

183
00:13:09,293 --> 00:13:10,540
We really got this!

184
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:11,660
It's not over!

185
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,860
Pull him down!

186
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:15,960
Strawhat! Savings!

187
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:18,460
Yeah, it's all you! Here on out!

188
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:22,517
I've got to admit, I didn't think
Whitebeard would gamble it all on you.

189
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,100
It's been a fun ride.

190
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:27,240
But don't kid yourself, boy.

191
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:37,380
Well, don't that beat all.

192
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:39,620
It's gonna be a good show.

193
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:42,055
Why don't you just sit back and watch?

194
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,840
Reef?

195
00:13:58,240 --> 00:14:00,140
We did it!

196
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:01,940
I'm here!

197
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:20,100
Is Garp gonna fight too?

198
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,280
Grandpa!

199
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,520
Get out of the way

200
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:30,660
I'm not moving a damned edge
I'm a vice-admiral of the Navy

201
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:34,377
I've been fighting
pirates since long before

202
00:14:34,460 --> 00:14:37,640
you were born and I ain't stopping today

203
00:14:42,380 --> 00:14:45,737
You're not my grandson
here you are the pirate

204
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:49,620
Straw Hat Luffy and I'll
fight you to the death

205
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:54,960
This is the path that you chose to take!

206
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:58,080
You and your brother alike.

207
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,489
The bridge is going to
give out, straw boy!

208
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:10,197
You got to move it or lose
it, whatever it takes!

209
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,260
Don't give up!

210
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:13,080
Almost there.

211
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,420
You want to pass me?

212
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:20,034
Then treat me like any other marine
you've faced and fight for your life!

213
00:15:42,380 --> 00:15:44,040
Grandpa, this kind of hurts.

214
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:47,535
Why do you want me to fight
these dumb monkeys all day?

215
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:53,877
It's your training.

216
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,457
Training sucks.

217
00:15:55,540 --> 00:16:00,057
For one, I have to get hit all
the time and for two, I'm hungry.

218
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:04,437
Don't be a baby.

219
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:07,017
You're gonna be a fine marine someday.

220
00:16:07,100 --> 00:16:08,137
Just like me.

221
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:11,237
Oh, I'm gonna be a pirate.

222
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,960
Marines are all lame.

223
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,790
Huh?

224
00:16:16,873 --> 00:16:18,340
You little punk

225
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:24,300
The monkeys hit hard, but
you're even worse, Gramps

226
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,800
I'm not hurting you!

227
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,360
Just move!

228
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:38,040
If you don't strike me dead,
then you'll lose Ace Shut up!

229
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:42,320
You can't just cry till you get
your way I won't show you mercy!

230
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:45,920
You're a pirate, Luffy!

231
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,480
That makes you my enemy!

232
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:17,260
Luffy!

233
00:17:18,080 --> 00:17:18,910
Luffy!

234
00:17:29,820 --> 00:17:31,220
Garp!

235
00:18:03,900 --> 00:18:05,488
Damn it, this is all wrong.

236
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,999
How the hell am I supposed to feel?

237
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:10,420
Pops, Luffy, my friends.

238
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:12,137
They're going to save me,

239
00:18:12,220 --> 00:18:15,867
but they're pushing through a
sea of their own blood to do it.

240
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:17,140
I'm sick.

241
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,300
These are tears of joy.

242
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:25,720
Even after all I've done, I want to live.

243
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:37,020
He took down Garp?

244
00:18:44,580 --> 00:18:48,120
They're family after all damn it.

245
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:54,160
Look at that I believe
he just might make it.

246
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:58,957
Change your mind I thought
you said he couldn't do it.

247
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:02,837
I didn't say he could save
Ace now that he's at the top.

248
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,077
They'll die together that's all.

249
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,460
Shut your mouth.

250
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:17,300
You let your guard down.

251
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:40,280
Finally, I'm here.

252
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:42,560
Hold on.

253
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:46,400
Take this.

254
00:19:47,580 --> 00:19:49,992
It's the key to your brother's handcuffs.

255
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:52,160
I got the key right here.

256
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:55,800
That's great, but how?

257
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:21,960
What the hell is that?

258
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:27,240
That's Sengoku's power.

259
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,598
I've never seen it.

260
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:29,661
Damn, he's huge.

261
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:34,025
Figure all your life, but you're
trapped in the palm of my hand.

262
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:43,220
This is insane!

263
00:20:43,660 --> 00:20:44,940
A gold statue?

264
00:20:49,860 --> 00:20:52,597
That's not something you
should have, Straw Hat.

265
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,560
Let's fix that, shall we?

266
00:20:57,120 --> 00:20:59,660
No! The key! Take aim!

267
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:03,720
Wait until I give the
order, but prepare to fire!

268
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:05,657
Oh, crap!

269
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:06,720
I lost it!

270
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:09,500
You've dug your own grave.

271
00:21:09,900 --> 00:21:12,240
You're a criminal as well, Straw Hat.

272
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:13,460
I've had enough!

273
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:16,760
I will execute the both of you.

274
00:21:17,300 --> 00:21:19,840
Right here, it was my own fair hands.

275
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:28,040
My goodness.

276
00:21:28,540 --> 00:21:31,481
I think I must have passed
out for a moment there.

277
00:21:34,560 --> 00:21:35,800
Strawhead, what?

278
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:38,330
Wait, three?

279
00:21:38,413 --> 00:21:39,620
Why are you here?

280
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:49,200
What is that thing?

281
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:52,880
Three, quick, protect Ace with the wall!

282
00:21:53,140 --> 00:21:54,580
I'm not losing now!

283
00:21:56,780 --> 00:21:59,200
I've got a giant balloon!

284
00:22:03,460 --> 00:22:04,860
Candy War!

285
00:22:09,140 --> 00:22:10,480
What's she doing?

286
00:22:21,220 --> 00:22:27,077
The whole scaffold's coming down what
happened up there ain't you still alive?

287
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:31,997
This is awful I'll make a key

288
00:22:32,080 --> 00:22:34,580
get those cuffs off him and hurry!

289
00:22:35,780 --> 00:22:40,277
You got it look captain buggy
that's where brother three

290
00:22:40,360 --> 00:22:43,940
wins holy crap I thought he
Hightailed it out of the stump,

291
00:22:44,040 --> 00:22:45,957
but now he's right in the middle of it.

292
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:48,280
Also, what the hell is he wearing?

293
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,652
Where's the replacement?

294
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:56,017
What could possibly be taking him so long?

295
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:59,571
Well, it was short notice that
we don't do this very often.

296
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,180
Hey, you ready?

297
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,460
Fine, let's move.

298
00:23:11,080 --> 00:23:13,857
Frankly I couldn't care
less about your brother.

299
00:23:13,940 --> 00:23:14,957
I'm here.

300
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:17,337
Out of respect for my late comrade.

301
00:23:17,420 --> 00:23:19,177
Laugh at me if you like.

302
00:23:19,260 --> 00:23:20,436
But here's your key.

303
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:23,320
Why would I laugh at that?

304
00:23:24,100 --> 00:23:24,930
Fire.

305
00:23:25,013 --> 00:23:27,288
Blow the tippets before
they hit the ground.

306
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:30,870
Here.

307
00:23:30,953 --> 00:23:31,783
Good luck.

308
00:23:31,866 --> 00:23:33,200
Thanks three.

309
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:50,160
That doesn't look good. Luffy!

310
00:23:51,060 --> 00:23:52,400
Hey, stop!

311
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,300
Brother 3!

312
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:58,820
That is an ugly way to go.

313
00:24:00,140 --> 00:24:02,258
Those handcuffs are sea prism stone.

314
00:24:02,820 --> 00:24:04,897
Firefist's power won't
be able to save him.

315
00:24:04,980 --> 00:24:07,509
Pretty sure we got
Straw Hat in there, too.

316
00:24:23,180 --> 00:24:24,240
What is that?

317
00:24:24,520 --> 00:24:26,461
It looks like a tunnel of flames!

318
00:24:27,080 --> 00:24:31,609
Ever since you were little, you've never
listened to a word I said, have you?

319
00:24:34,540 --> 00:24:36,940
Then you run off and do something crazy.

320
00:24:42,440 --> 00:24:45,120
Like old times, huh, Luffy?

321
00:24:47,260 --> 00:24:48,440
They're alive!

322
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,661
Well, of course!

323
00:24:52,020 --> 00:24:54,300
It's a true miracle!

324
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,621
Hey, I see them!

325
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,560
Look there in the flames!

326
00:25:08,280 --> 00:25:10,140
Let's go!
